# BenchMARL — models

- **Here**: [`heterognn.py`](../../BenchMARL/benchmarl/models/heterognn.py) (`active_mask` → **edge filter**, omitted from feature concat), [`edgeweightedHGT.py`](../../BenchMARL/benchmarl/models/edgeweightedHGT.py) (opt-in low-rank edge-conditioned HGT), [`transformer.py`](../../BenchMARL/benchmarl/models/transformer.py), [`ego_entity_gnn.py`](../../BenchMARL/benchmarl/models/ego_entity_gnn.py) when used.
- **Elsewhere**: [`hgteam_modules.py`](../../BenchMARL/benchmarl/algorithms/hgteam_modules.py) is under **`algorithms/`** (algorithms-scoped rule).
- **Specs**: Match env `CompositeSpec`; **`active_mask`** is metadata ([`docs/agent_quickstart.md`](../../docs/agent_quickstart.md)).
- **Algorithms**: Coordinate logits / shapes with `benchmarl/algorithms/*`.
- **Check**: [`test_shared_gnn.py`](../../test_shared_gnn.py) or short smoke. For `EdgeWeightedHGT`, run [`smoke_test_edgeweightedhgt.py`](../../smoke_test_edgeweightedhgt.py).
